# Spartak v3 asset suite: commit the web-weight deliverables that the site
# serves (transparent-png 1x, flat-jpg, banners jpg/webp). Heavy source archives
# and QA artifacts live under ignored design-source/spartak-auto-v3/ so they are
# never served. Keep print-res @2x cutouts on disk only -- never in git history.
